2026-07-27T14:28:37.0355064Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:28:37.0356525Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:28:37.0357134Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
